    "updated_at": "2023-02-27T11:38:24Z",
    "body": "Thanks. I will make a PR unless you get there first.\r\n\r\nIf I understand correctly, it was popular to send multiple concatenated streams in HTTP responses when people didn't have a proper streaming compressor available. I don't know how much that is a problem nowadays. They wouldn't have been raw streams anyway.",
